    "termsOfAccess": "Data sharing: Interview transcripts have been pseudonymized by removing direct identifiable information, such as name, workplace etc. However, individuals may still risk being identifiable due to contextual information. The qualitative interview data are therefore not openly available. Data may be accessed for re-use in scientific research upon request, with the involvement of the original research team, and subject to ethical and data protection requirements. Upon a request to access the data, a data transfer agreement will be drafted specifying the terms of use of the data to protect data in accordance to the GDPR. Additional research records are stored at the internal archive of the Division of Pharmacoepidemiology and Clinical Pharmacology, and can be accessed to facilitate data re-use.",
